    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Cat Farm Begins! \ud83d\udc3e\ud83c\udf34</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Live on the Island\u2026 and Survive!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a new life on a sunny island! Your cat has a small plot of land, but there\u2019s a catch \u2014 rent is due every 5 days! Stay alive as long as you can by growing crops, completing orders, and enjoying the peaceful island life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Build, Upgrade, Expand! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and place useful structures to make your island more efficient!<br>Build garden beds, sprinklers, a grill, a well, a greenhouse, a humidifier, and more. Design your perfect workflow and keep your farm running smoothly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/dcde8f3fe9371e0bc76415654ba0ed4d.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/dcde8f3fe9371e0bc76415654ba0ed4d.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Plant It. Care for It. Harvest It! \ud83c\udf31</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy seeds, plant crops, water them daily, and harvest fresh produce. Sell what you grow or use it to cook meals \u2014 all to earn coins and pay rent on time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/35086d5b5c9212f6c446c07c375728fc.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/35086d5b5c9212f6c446c07c375728fc.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Fire Up the Grill! \ud83c\udf62</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grill is your kitchen companion! Use fresh vegetables to prepare delicious dishes and fulfill customer orders. Cooking is a vital part of survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/06c59fea9fe30a188982992781fd3c89.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/06c59fea9fe30a188982992781fd3c89.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Cast a Line and Relax \ud83c\udfa3</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break and go fishing! Catch fish, complete fishing-related tasks, and unlock new opportunities as you enjoy life by the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/33d3e62465a915993190d70becfe5d3d.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/33d3e62465a915993190d70becfe5d3d.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Decorate Your Island \ud83c\udf3a</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add your personal touch! Lay down paths, plant flower beds, and place decorations to make your island a cozy, stylish home in the middle of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Customize Your Cat \ud83d\udc31</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cat, your style! Choose glasses, backpacks, hats, and fur color to create a look that\u2019s all your own. Show off your feline farmer in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/2e47a5d44573bb276ac7231fe80fe2e0.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/2e47a5d44573bb276ac7231fe80fe2e0.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Time Flies\u2026 Rent Is Coming</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The days pass quickly on the island. Every 5 days, rent is due. Plan ahead, manage your resources, and don\u2019t let your island dream fade away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for the challenge?</strong><br><br><i><strong>Meowland: Island Farm</strong></i><strong> is waiting for you! \ud83d\udc3e</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Cat Farm Begins! \ud83d\udc3e\ud83c\udf34</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Live on the Island\u2026 and Survive!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a new life on a sunny island! Your cat has a small plot of land, but there\u2019s a catch \u2014 rent is due every 5 days! Stay alive as long as you can by growing crops, completing orders, and enjoying the peaceful island life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Build, Upgrade, Expand! \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and place useful structures to make your island more efficient!<br>Build garden beds, sprinklers, a grill, a well, a greenhouse, a humidifier, and more. Design your perfect workflow and keep your farm running smoothly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/dcde8f3fe9371e0bc76415654ba0ed4d.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/dcde8f3fe9371e0bc76415654ba0ed4d.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Plant It. Care for It. Harvest It! \ud83c\udf31</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy seeds, plant crops, water them daily, and harvest fresh produce. Sell what you grow or use it to cook meals \u2014 all to earn coins and pay rent on time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/35086d5b5c9212f6c446c07c375728fc.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/35086d5b5c9212f6c446c07c375728fc.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Fire Up the Grill! \ud83c\udf62</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grill is your kitchen companion! Use fresh vegetables to prepare delicious dishes and fulfill customer orders. Cooking is a vital part of survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/06c59fea9fe30a188982992781fd3c89.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/06c59fea9fe30a188982992781fd3c89.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Cast a Line and Relax \ud83c\udfa3</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break and go fishing! Catch fish, complete fishing-related tasks, and unlock new opportunities as you enjoy life by the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/33d3e62465a915993190d70becfe5d3d.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/33d3e62465a915993190d70becfe5d3d.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Decorate Your Island \ud83c\udf3a</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add your personal touch! Lay down paths, plant flower beds, and place decorations to make your island a cozy, stylish home in the middle of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Customize Your Cat \ud83d\udc31</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cat, your style! Choose glasses, backpacks, hats, and fur color to create a look that\u2019s all your own. Show off your feline farmer in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/2e47a5d44573bb276ac7231fe80fe2e0.poster.avif?t=1745765499\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369340/extras/2e47a5d44573bb276ac7231fe80fe2e0.webm?t=1745765499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Time Flies\u2026 Rent Is Coming</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The days pass quickly on the island. Every 5 days, rent is due. Plan ahead, manage your resources, and don\u2019t let your island dream fade away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for the challenge?</strong><br><br><i><strong>Meowland: Island Farm</strong></i><strong> is waiting for you! \ud83d\udc3e</strong></p>",
